{"reviewId": "304379475_845tCaSjw", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "20 世纪早期的俄国科学家因特・A.L. 柴可夫斯基通过对 72 个不同国家、近 2500 年的混乱和骚动事件研究发现，太阳黑子活动与人类情绪密切相关，80% 的重大事件都发生在太阳黑子活动最活跃的 5 年中。当太阳活动加剧时，人类心理压力增加，暴力行为增多；太阳活动减弱时，负面事件发生率降低到 20%。\n太阳黑子极小值年份与全球性经济衰退往往在时间上高度吻合，如 1933 年是太阳黑子极小值年份，也是资本主义世界大萧条的谷底；2008 年是第 24 太阳黑子周期的起点（极小值），当年全球爆发了金融危机。有学者认为太阳活动周期与朱格拉周期（投资周期）存在关联，每个太阳黑子周期对应一个朱格拉周期或 3 个基钦周期（库存周期）。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "研究者认为，除了农产品价格，太阳黑子以一种未知的原因影响着人类的情绪和商业行为，从而成为决定周期的另一重要因素。", "range": "18460-18516", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "304379475_845tCaSjw", "userVid": 304379475, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761118436, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 304379475, "name": "夏杨", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/wcib2GksmGOk9ryziaPUQKnkPqIM3P7rwApZsibVDaJEdzNIwIjFqQ2ZZuOXjQEbvrlDWAONTKmOWI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "夏杨", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 394643644, "name": "Horace", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/6c5Ah1BQ2KUKwDH0F2GvzKPkqoeogU9PQIZqpw4d0phbJib8Jbgu3aWSbxFmJMZozU53uGJ6Cdb0nXiaTTY7XFS6r7nj4TeyjAME35MQxxfY4/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅